      "author_id": "1542707718",
      "text": "From initial concept to in-game reality, explore the artistic journey of Rust in The Art of Rust, a beautifully crafted, full-colour hardback book.\n🎨☢️📖\n\nGet yours here: https://t.co/sgXegXlAGE https://t.co/CD37pdM8O9",
