    {
      "id": "2122343890678095913",
      "author_id": "1542707718",
      "text": "Workbenches no longer require blueprint fragments to craft, and scrap isn’t used on the tech trees. 🛠️☢️🪾\n\nInstead, we’re introducing three tiers of blueprints: blueprint fragments, blueprint pages and blueprint books. These are the new currencies spent to progress tech trees, one for each tech tree level.\n\nRead more on our DevBlog: https://t.co/MF9kei76SG",
      "url": "https://x.com/playrust/status/2122343890678095913",
      "expanded_urls": [
        "https://rust.facepunch.com/news/printed_and_polished"
      ],
